.TH MOUSE_RELEASED 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
mouse_released \- True only on the frame the button came up
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqinput.h\(dq
.BI "bool mouse_released(const Input *in, MouseButton b);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True only on the frame the button came up. Use to end a drag or a slingshot pull.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true if button b is up now and was down last frame.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/input.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mouse_pressed (3),
.BR mouse_down (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
